  "h2": [
    ".",
    "Review us",
    "24-HR EMERGENCY",
    "SERVICE AVAILABLE",
    "CALL US NOW",
    "773 - 4-NORMAN\n773 - 466-7626",
    ".",
    "Review us",
    "About Us",
    "Dependable, Honest Plumbers in Chicagoland and Beyond",
    "Who We Are",
    "Our Promise To You",
    "We pledge to provide you with top-quality services at honest, upfront pricing. We’ll make sure you know the cost of the job before we even start. Expect first-class customer service from our friendly and respectful staff, who pay meticulous attention to every detail. We pride ourselves on arriving on time for every scheduled appointment. Above all, your satisfaction is guaranteed. With us, you’re choosing a partner who values integrity and excellence in every aspect of our service.",
    "Our Mission",
    "Our mission is to deliver unparalleled plumbing services to our community by combining the highest quality of workmanship with an unwavering commitment to honesty and fairness in pricing. We strive to exceed your expectations, ensuring that each client receives top-tier service at a reasonable cost, without compromising on quality or efficiency.",
    "Our Core Values",
    "Our approach to serving our community is deeply rooted in a firm set of values that guide our every action and interaction. These values are not just words on a page; they are principles we live by, ensuring that our clients receive the best possible service while fostering a culture of excellence among our team. Below are the six core values that stand at the heart of everything we do:",
    "These core values are more than just guiding principles; they are a commitment to you, our valued client, that every interaction with us will be a positive, fulfilling experience.",
    "Our Target Areas",
    "We are proud to serve a wide range of locations, ensuring our values and services reach as many clients as possible. Our expert team is ready to address your plumbing needs in the following cities:",
    "What Sets Us Apart From the Competition?",
    "Our dedication to excellence sets us apart in a crowded market, with several key differentiators making our service unparalleled:",
    "request a service",
    "Client testimonials",
    "Make Us Your First-Choice Plumbers in Elgin, IL",
    "Are you searching for an honest “plumber near me” in Elgin, IL, and the surrounding areas? Look no further than Norman Mechanical We stand out in the community for our unwavering commitment to excellence, honesty, and integrity in every job we undertake. Our team of highly skilled plumbers brings a wealth of experience and expertise, ensuring that no plumbing issue, big or small, remains unsolved. With Norman Mechanical, you’re choosing a company that values prompt service, transparent pricing, and lasting solutions. We’re not just experts in our field; we’re your neighbors dedicated to maintaining the comfort and safety of your home. Our round-the-clock availability means we’re always there when you need us most, providing peace of mind that’s just a phone call away. Make the smart choice; make Norman Mechanical your first-choice plumbers in Elgin, IL, and experience the difference dedication makes.",
    "or",
    "Need Help Now? Call Us!\t\t\t\t\t\t \n(773)466-7626",
    "LICENSE # CFC143083",
    "Services",
